==== AimingPerkMinAngleModifier ====
Parameter for weapons. A modifier that determines how much the Aim skill affects the aiming angle.
<syntaxhighlight lang="Java">
AimingPerkMinAngleModifier = 0.05,
</syntaxhighlight>

